     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Often, a client with age-related degenerative disorders such as osteoarthritis will have limited ROM and increased pain upon ROM of the joints. This simple screening provides valuable information for the diagnosis of osteoarthritis as well as the treatment parameters for the client."
